// PangoLint expect: deltavalue-midi-slot-context
// PangoLint fail: DefineMidiTrigger handler with spaced DeltaValue property command
// Purpose: verify DefineMidiTrigger/InRangeTrigger label handlers do not provide a DeltaValue context.
// BEYOND validation 2026-05-07: parser error on the handler body before any MIDI trigger can emit OSC output.
// BEYOND parser error: Unknown function, undeclared or not initialized variable: deltavalue.
// BEYOND parser error: Error in command.
// BEYOND parser location: line 16, text `Master.PhFriction deltavalue (-1,1)`.
// Object tree note: Master.PhFriction exists in the BEYOND object tree as /b/Master/PhFriction.

var requestId

requestId = "pangolint-candidate-deltavalue-trigger-property-001"

DefineMidiTrigger 0xB0, 0x00, "PangoLint DeltaValue trigger"
InRangeTrigger 64, 64, "ApplyDeltaValue"
exit

ApplyDeltaValue:
Master.PhFriction deltavalue (-1,1)
OscOutTTS "/pangolint/candidate/deltavalue/trigger-property", "s", requestId
